sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Router
    participant Model as Streaming model
    participant Trace@{ "type": "entity" } as Trace collector

    Client->>+Router: POST /v1/messages (stream=true)
    Router->>+Model: forward prompt, 2 400 tokens
    par_over tokens and telemetry share the wall clock
        Model--)Router: token deltas
        Router--)Client: SSE data frames
    and
        Router-)Trace: span(ttft=180ms)
    end
    Model-->>-Router: stop_reason=end_turn
    Router-->>-Client: message_stop
